      "text": [
        "5905 - وَ قَالَ اَلصَّادِقُ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : \"إِنَّ اَللَّهَ تَبَارَكَ وَ تَعَالَى قَسَمَ بَيْنَكُمْ أَخْلاَقَكُمْ كَمَا قَسَمَ بَيْنَكُمْ أَرْزَاقَكُمْ\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5905 - Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) said:\n\"Indeed, Allah (swt), the Blessed and Exalted, has distributed your manners among you just as He (swt) has distributed your sustenance among you.\""
        ]
      }
